  "details": "Version:\nVRChat build 994\nVRCSDK3-AVATAR-2020.09.25.00.08_Public\n(likely affects earlier versions too)\nDescription of the bug:\nLocal avatar testing avatar does not update upon reupload. Requires restart of client to work.\nClearing VRChat cache does not seem to help.\nI've seen 4 other people on the Discord with this issue this month.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n1. Upload local test avatar\n2. Make obvious changes to it (such as placing a cube next to it)\n3. Reupload\n4. Change to the new version in game\n5. Observe that the obvious change is not there.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):",
